    "created_at": "2023-09-18T12:18:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-18T12:18:49Z",
    "body": "If you need this for extensions in particular, it seems more appropriate to add an extension API for this. Making `toggle` composed would violate shadow tree encapsulation.",
