    "created_at": "2023-09-23T02:51:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-23T02:51:27Z",
    "body": "It sounds like you're afraid of using popovers because their behavior could change in the future and your extension will break. I hope you can have more trust in us to keep the API working so that you can use it today, especially since it is already implemented in chromium and webkit.\r\n\r\nI don't really have strong opinions on composed vs non-composed events since I don't know which ones are composed or not at the moment, but I trust Anne's judgement here.",
