    "created_at": "2023-09-26T10:26:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-26T10:26:01Z",
    "body": "The only events we compose are those that could naturally occur on a shadow host, such as a mousemove or click. I.e., user input events. toggle is not one of those events and would leak the shadow tree.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
