    "created_at": "2023-10-22T02:34:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-22T02:34:41Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure what's the meaning of `leak the shadow tree`, but I insist that:\r\n- such a \"frame-level\" feature should expose its frame-level impact to other page components\r\n\r\nAnd I wish the HTML spec could take a glance at us web-extension developers, and:\r\n- provide at least one exact way to do something on such important frame-level events as this one.",
